        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="ADL5303ACPZ-R7损坏"><a href="#ADL5303ACPZ-R7损坏" class="headerlink" title="ADL5303ACPZ-R7损坏"></a>ADL5303ACPZ-R7损坏</h1><p>检查C57两端电压为0V，应为0.5V，故</p><h1 id="OPA704UA损坏"><a href="#OPA704UA损坏" class="headerlink" title="OPA704UA损坏"></a>OPA704UA损坏</h1><p>电压跟随器输出和输出电压不相等，芯片损坏</p><h1 id="ADS8866读数为0"><a href="#ADS8866读数为0" class="headerlink" title="ADS8866读数为0"></a>ADS8866读数为0</h1><p>前天ADC读数正常，今天ADC读数一直为0</p><p>芯片使用三线通信，查阅数据手册需将DIN拉高</p><p><img src="/images/%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%BF.png" alt="三线"></p>]]></content>
      
      
